Package: CorPresDefl
Title: Three-Phase Corneal Net Pressure-Volume Slopes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Qi", "Ren", email = "GulumimiRen@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculate three transformed net pressure-volume endpoint slopes
    from corneal deflection volume at first applanation, highest concavity,
    and second applanation. Includes a reference pressure waveform,
    vectorized inputs, and data-frame workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/GulumimiRen/CorPresDefl
BugReports: https://github.com/GulumimiRen/CorPresDefl/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
